# cards: Lucia at level 13 wears Vitra (card 235, her slot 0x020B46FE) with 1300 points (0x020B48AA). Her list
# has her five spells and no card entry (shot bt_list); Right to Tender Rain shows the up arrow (bt_name); A casts
# on both allies with their HP poked to 100. Expect: both HP to full, Lucia's MP down by Tender Rain's cost,
# points 1300 -> 1100 (an all-ally cast takes 200). Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba1a 1
poke u16 0x020b48aa 1300
poke u16 0x020b46fe 235
poke u32 0x020b46c0 12
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u32 0x0228e874 hp_0
watch u32 0x0228e8e0 hp_1
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 lucia_mp
watch u16 0x020b48aa points
poke u32 0x0228e874 100
poke u32 0x0228e8e0 100
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot bt_list
press Right 8
wait 30
shot bt_name
press A 8
wait 60
wait 250
shot bt_0
wait 250
shot bt_1
wait 250
shot bt_2
